  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/cucumber?source=modrinth\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex; text-align: center;\"><a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/docs/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=文件&amp;message=查看&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"https://blakesmods.com/wiki/cucumber\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=維基&amp;message=查看&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Cucumber 是一個模組，包含了我的其他模組所使用的共享程式碼與功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">當啟用進階提示時，為方塊和物品添加顯示其標籤（Tags）的工具提示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">當啟用進階提示時，為物品添加顯示其 NBT 資料的工具提示。（預設為關閉）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #000000;\"><strong>我的模組</strong></span><span style=\"color: #008000; font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-agriculture\">Mystical Agriculture</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-agradditions\">Mystical Agradditions</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-automation\">Mystical Automation</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-customization\">Mystical Customization</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/extended-crafting\">Extended Crafting</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pickle-tweaks\">Pickle Tweaks</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/iron-jetpacks\">Iron Jetpacks</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-buckets\">More Buckets</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/blakesmods\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/fdf1b29a-987b-450e-b6d4-a16c2da8aadf.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></span></p>",
